 "summary": "XH is a single-row wire-to-board connector family on a 2.5 mm pitch: crimp contacts in a housing on the wire, mating with a shrouded box header on the board. B2B-XH-A is the 2-circuit through-hole top-entry header, posts 0.64 mm square, 7 mm body height, 9.8 mm mounted height with the housing in place. The family also has side-entry, glass-filled, bossed, SMT and radial-taped headers from 1 to 20 circuits. It is rated 3 A (AWG #22) and 250 V AC/DC, over -25 to +85 °C.",
