   "text": "Wires are crimped into SXH contacts held in an XHP housing; the housing plugs onto a box-shaped shrouded header and can be unplugged again. The contact is a folded beam. The connector conforms to the HA terminal. Mounted height above the board is 9.8 mm."
  },
